{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":[],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Add brand facts"},"description":"Add brand facts to a website's Knowledge Base in bulk (1-50 per call). Each fact runs the full ingestion pipeline (deduplication, approval gates, pillar routing); there is no way to force-approve. Returns one outcome per fact (approved | pending | duplicate; extensible) with the created fact id and the pillar it was filed under. Facts without a pillar_id are routed automatically and may land unfiled. A fact similar to facts already in the Knowledge Base is not added: its outcome is duplicate and lists them under matches, and the response carries a match_token. To resolve, call again with those facts, the match_token, one decision per listed match (approve, optionally with new text, or delete) and save_submitted (true adds the facts as written, false only applies the decisions).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decisions":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["approve","delete"],"type":"string"},"claim_id":{"type":"string"},"text":{"maxLength":2000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["claim_id","action"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"facts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"pillar_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"source_url":{"maxLength":2048,"type":"string"},"text":{"maxLength":2000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["text"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"match_token":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"save_submitted":{"type":"boolean"},"website_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8